      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p>bushtail here! I decided to switch up the names of my utility mods to be more indicative of what they do.</p>\n<p>This one allows you to edit the <strong>whitelist</strong> (accidental misnomer when I was writing it) of the shelves in the Hall of Fame (PlaceOfFame in BSG naming). Axes of items are not changed, so not everything will look as they should.</p>\n<p>The config file is generated with a set of default values at first start (all armbands in the small shelf slots, and the GPU in the large shelf slots’ whitelist). Please <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jsonlint.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">lint</a> your config JSON before reporting any issues.</p>\n",
